{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jigsaw Industry is a game that allows you to unleash your creativity and fully enjoy the fun of thinking. Design your own factory to combine and process different shapes and colors. A fully automated and intelligent factory can be achieved through digital circuits, logic signals, and other means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can perform basic cutting, combining, coloring, and color matching operations on graphics by arranging various facilities in an orderly manner,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can perform various intelligent operations by connecting digital logic signals to achieve fully automatic intelligent puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can write your own signal processing components using Lua programming language to achieve custom signal processing</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Essence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/a830f6447a4ac9fd564cddcc4f27fb5a6ce247d3.jpg"},{"name":"All Roads Lead to Rome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/86402ed3cacf94adb1c3c737c6aab0d119df7a49.jpg"},{"name":"Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/a1a2ed6ea8bc413abbc2c9aa9e4aa98851aad46a.jpg"},{"name":"Other Side","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/c22a5b98e821e3b836686764b349707006f01794.jpg"},{"name":"Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/8b6c539dda86364bbc6e90a5e53bd55b2179f55b.jpg"},{"name":"Confused and Disoriented","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/e0328f6f524fa794bc03290918a72b7a8b83e115.jpg"},{"name":"Ripper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2996290/8d9c82d053dd2b7118dd97583f8a7fc9845c589d.jpg"},{"name":"Colorful","path":"https://cdn.akama